-- NORM-LOG N10 goal A: a RAND keeps feeding its other operand after one side breaches (R-T3).
-- Pass: bobSigned is recorded in the first two traces, and every trace is BREACHED naming alice.
IMPORT prelude
DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF alice, bob
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF Sign HAS who IS AN Actor
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
c MEANS (PARTY alice MUST Sign alice WITHIN 3) RAND (PARTY bob MUST Sign bob WITHIN 9 HENCE RECORD `bobSigned` IS TRUE HENCE FULFILLED)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
d MEANS (PARTY bob MUST Sign bob WITHIN 9 HENCE RECORD `bobSigned` IS TRUE HENCE FULFILLED) RAND (PARTY alice MUST Sign alice WITHIN 3)
#TRACE c AT 0 WITH (`WAIT UNTIL` 5)   PARTY bob DOES Sign bob AT 6   (`WAIT UNTIL` 20)
#TRACE d AT 0 WITH (`WAIT UNTIL` 5)   PARTY bob DOES Sign bob AT 6   (`WAIT UNTIL` 20)
#TRACE c AT 0 WITH (`WAIT UNTIL` 5)   (`WAIT UNTIL` 20)
